{"1963510": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Herald of Havoc", "steam_appid": 1963510, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1963510/extras/584b94e5b37354969a703c77f65d4342.poster.avif?t=1781596538\" width=450 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1963510/extras/584b94e5b37354969a703c77f65d4342.webm?t=1781596538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1963510/extras/584b94e5b37354969a703c77f65d4342.mp4?t=1781596538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A campaign with 21 short and varied levels. Ranging from relatively calm levels with a lot of exploration and secrets... to huge arenas with hundreds of enemies at the screen. It takes roughly 3 hours to beat on normal difficulty without looking for secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Need more? An Survival Mode is present with a Steam leaderboard. Loot random items and survive waves of enemies. 4 maps are available, ranging from simple arenas, to more complex maps with doors to unlock, and traps to activate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 12 unique weapons, each one having a primary and secondary fire, (and even a tertiary special ability for some of them). Some shoot bullets, some call down a huge lightning strike, one can even open a portal that spawn skeletons that fight for you... There's much more. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1963510/extras/c7647af992bea89e5d080a7601ec36be.poster.avif?t=1781596538\" width=450 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1963510/extras/c7647af992bea89e5d080a7601ec36be.webm?t=1781596538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1963510/extras/c7647af992bea89e5d080a7601ec36be.mp4?t=1781596538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1963510/extras/584b94e5b37354969a703c77f65d4342.poster.avif?t=1781596538\" width=450 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1963510/extras/584b94e5b37354969a703c77f65d4342.webm?t=1781596538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1963510/extras/584b94e5b37354969a703c77f65d4342.mp4?t=1781596538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A campaign with 21 short and varied levels. Ranging from relatively calm levels with a lot of exploration and secrets... to huge arenas with hundreds of enemies at the screen. It takes roughly 3 hours to beat on normal difficulty without looking for secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Need more? An Survival Mode is present with a Steam leaderboard. Loot random items and survive waves of enemies. 4 maps are available, ranging from simple arenas, to more complex maps with doors to unlock, and traps to activate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 12 unique weapons, each one having a primary and secondary fire, (and even a tertiary special ability for some of them). Some shoot bullets, some call down a huge lightning strike, one can even open a portal that spawn skeletons that fight for you... There's much more. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1963510/extras/c7647af992bea89e5d080a7601ec36be.poster.avif?t=1781596538\" width=450 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1963510/extras/c7647af992bea89e5d080a7601ec36be.webm?t=1781596538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1963510/extras/c7647af992bea89e5d080a7601ec36be.mp4?t=1781596538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Grab huge guns, mow down hundreds of enemies, reach the end of the level, repeat. It doesn't get any simpler than this. Embark on a 3 hour campaign with varied environments and situations, and beat the leaderboard on a tightly crafted survival mode.", "supported_languages": "English", "reviews": "“I'm gonna have to change my pants multiple times here it's ridiculous”<br />\r\nMR_ICARUS<br />\r\n<br />\r\n“That was one hell of an experience!”<br />\r\nHyacsho<br />\r\n<br />\r\n“Every single map of episode 2 was remarkable in one way or another”<br />\r\nCoincident<br />\r\n", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1963510/49b93c935a47947135865068cd050a4e63226117/header.jpg?t=1781596538", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1963510/c2f54c5314ad14ad5086dd72993bb665f3974e24/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781596538", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1963510/c2f54c5314ad14ad5086dd72993bb665f3974e24/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781596538", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 / Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.5 G